02:03:37.480 --> 02:03:39.040 line:63%
 Il y a assez de personnel 
 en formation. 

02:03:39.080 --> 02:03:40.960 line:61%
 Tout cela va se régler." 

02:03:41.000 --> 02:03:42.360 line:63%
 En 2014, j'ai dit: 
 "Les déserts médicaux, 

02:03:42.400 --> 02:03:43.800 line:61%
 ça continue. 

